{"speciesId":544,"names":{"fr":"Scobolide","es":"Whirlipede","en":"Whirlipede","ja":"ホイーガ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Protégé par sa solide carapace, il fonce sur ses ennemis en roulant comme un pneu."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Protected by a hard shell, it spins its body like a wheel and crashes furiously into its enemies."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"En général, il reste immobile. Mais quand on l’attaque, il se met à tourbillonner à toute vitesse et fonce sur l’ennemi."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It is usually motionless, but when attacked, it rotates at high speed and then crashes into its opponent."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Storing energy for evolution, it sits. But, when predators approach, it moves to stab them with poison spikes."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Storing energy for evolution, it sits. But, when predators approach, it moves to stab them with poison spikes."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Protégé par sa solide carapace, il fonce sur ses ennemis en roulant comme un pneu."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Lo protege un duro caparazón. Gira como una rueda y realiza brutales placajes contra sus enemigos."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Protected by a hard shell, it spins its body like a wheel and crashes furiously into its enemies."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"硬い 殻に 守られている。 タイヤのように 回転して 敵に 激しく 体当たりする。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"En général, il reste immobile. Mais quand on l’attaque, il se met à tourbillonner à toute vitesse et fonce sur l’ennemi."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Normalmente no se mueve, pero se pone a rodar frenéticamente y contraataca con placajes si lo atacan."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It is usually motionless, but when attacked, it rotates at high speed and then crashes into its opponent."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"普段は 動かないが 襲